### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@token = 1|your_auth_token_here
@taskId = 1
@categoryId = 1

### 1. Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Dev",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. List Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Software Engineering"
}

### 6. List Tasks (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Filter Tasks by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?category_id={{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Filter Tasks by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=pending
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Search Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?search=API
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Laravel REST API",
  "description": "Follow best practices with Form Requests and API Resources",
  "status": "pending",
  "due_date": "2026-09-30",
  "category_id": 1
}

### 11. View Task
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Update Task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 13. Complete Task (Bonus Endpoint)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
